        <a href="https://edenhealthclubs.com/functional-medicine/wellness-injections/">Wellness Injections</a>
        <a href="https://edenhealthclubs.com/fitness-performance/">Fitness + Performance</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing-section">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
        <h2>Know the right protocol before paying for the wrong one.</h2>
        <p>
          Your consultation helps determine whether this protocol is appropriate and what
          level of support makes sense for your goals. Tesamorelin is personalized care,
          not a product on a shelf. Pricing is reviewed during your consultation so you
          leave with a clear plan and a clear number.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a class="button button--primary" href="#consult-form">Book a Consultation</a>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonial-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why it matters</p>
        <h2>Visceral fat does not reverse on its own.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-grid">
        <blockquote>The kind of fat Tesamorelin is studied for is metabolically active, hormonally tangled, and different from ordinary weight-loss frustration.</blockquote>
        <blockquote>The clients who shift it are usually the ones who get specific about the mechanism instead of trying harder at a general approach.</blockquote>
        <blockquote>Consult availability with Eden's clinical team is limited each week, and personalized protocols require clinical review.</blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
        <h2>Frequently asked.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        {faqItems.map((item) => (
          <details>
            <summary>{item.question}</summary>
