    <section class="split-section" id="consult-form">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Start with a consultation</p>
        <h2>Start with labs, body composition, and the right mechanism.</h2>
        <p>Eden will review your body-composition goals, GLP-1 history if relevant, medications, health history, IGF-1, metabolic markers, and whether Tesamorelin is clinically appropriate.</p>
        <p class="microcopy">
          Greenwood Village health club consults and telehealth follow-ups may be available for
          established Colorado patients.
        </p>
      </div>
      <LeadForm
        cta="Request My Tesamorelin Consultation"
